    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/immigration-consulting/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Immigration Consulting Theme is a premium, professional solution designed specifically for immigration consultants, visa lawyers, migration agencies, legal advisors, and relocation service providers. This theme provides a sleek, modern platform to showcase a wide range of immigration services including visa application assistance, work visa consulting, student visa consulting, family sponsorship, business visa support, and permanent residency support. Whether you are a Canadian immigration consultant, a USA immigration expert, or a UK visa consultant, this theme is built to display your expertise in handling visa services, green card services, express entry consulting, citizenship applications, refugee and asylum services, and investor visas. Its user-friendly interface, clean design, and responsive layout ensure that potential clients can easily navigate through information and access services like visa interview coaching, immigration workshops, and legal advice. The theme is optimized for SEO and features integrated contact forms, appointment scheduling, lead generation tools, and live chat support through the Contact Form 7 plugin to enhance customer engagement. Visually, the Immigration Consulting Theme boasts high-resolution banners, customizable sections, and interactive elements that highlight your services, client testimonials, blog updates, and success stories. Designed with a minimal yet sophisticated aesthetic, it aligns with modern corporate branding and conveys trust, authority, and professionalism—making it an essential tool for building a reputable and effective online presence in the immigration consultancy field."
    },
